          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Lawi 25:39-46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mtu akimpiga jicho mtumwa wake wa kiume au wa kike na kuliharibu jicho lake, ni lazima amwachilie aende huru bila malipo kwa ajili ya jicho lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hali kadhalika, akimpiga hata kumngoa jino mtumwa wake wa kiume au wa kike, ni lazima amwachilie huru kwa ajili ya jino lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ngombe akimpiga mtu pembe na kumwua, ng'ombe huyo atauawa kwa kupigwa mawe na nyama yake haitaliwa. Mwenye ng'ombe huyo hatakuwa na lawama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kama ng'ombe huyo amezoea kupiga watu pembe, na mwenyewe akaonywa lakini hakumfunga, kama ng'ombe huyo akiua mtu lazima apigwe mawe, na mwenyewe lazima auawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, huyo mtu akitozwa faini ili kuyaokoa maisha yake, ni lazima alipe kiasi kamili atakachotozwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngombe akimpiga pembe mtoto wa mtu mwingine, shauri hili litaamuliwa kwa njia hiyohiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama ng'ombe huyo akimpiga pembe mtumwa wa kiume au wa kike, mwenye ng'ombe atamlipa bwana wa huyo mtumwa fedha zenye thamani ya shekeli thelathini, na huyo ng'ombe lazima auawe kwa kupigwa mawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
